B.YL=new A.dW("what","faith","What Islam is","Islam means to submit to Allah. A Muslim is a person who does that. This is a short introduction, not a fatwa. For a ruling, ask the imam of this mosque.","Quran 3:19","Quran","3:19",null,B.fD)
B.YP=new A.dW("tawhid","faith","Allah is One","Muslims worship Allah alone. He has no partner, no child, and no equal. We do not worship the Prophet \ufdfa, the Kaaba, or any person.","Quran 112:1","Quran","112:1",null,B.ut)
B.YI=new A.dW("iman","faith","What a Muslim believes","A well-known hadith lists six: belief in Allah, His angels, His books, His messengers, the Last Day, and that Allah has already written what will happen. The wording here is a short meaning, not the full Arabic text.","Sahih al-Bukhari 50 \xb7 Sahih Muslim 8","Hadith",null,"This is the hadith of Jibril. Ask the imam if you want the full wording.",B.uq)
B.YU=new A.dW("prophet","faith","The Prophet Muhammad \ufdfa","Muhammad \ufdfa is the last messenger. We love him and follow him. We do not worship him. If you want to learn his life, ask this mosque for a class \u2014 do not take random videos as proof.","Quran 33:40","Quran","33:40",null,B.uA)
B.YQ=new A.dW("quran","faith","The Quran","The Quran is the word of Allah, in Arabic. English on a screen is a meaning, not a replacement. If a verse is hard, ask the imam. Do not use this app as tafsir.","Quran 2:2","Quran","2:2",null,B.nR)
B.W2=new A.a8(62751,"MaterialIcons",!1)
B.YS=new A.dW("pillars","worship","The five pillars","A well-known hadith names five: the testimony (shahada), the prayer, zakat, fasting in Ramadan, and Hajj for the one who is able. The wording here is a short meaning.","Sahih al-Bukhari 8 \xb7 Sahih Muslim 16","Hadith",null,"Open Shahada, Salah, Donate, and Events for the next steps.",B.W2)
B.W1=new A.a8(62746,"MaterialIcons",!1)
B.YJ=new A.dW("salah","worship","The five prayers","Prayer is at set times. In congregation, follow the imam. The usual fard units are: Fajr 2, Dhuhr 4, Asr 4, Maghrib 3, Isha 4. The mosque clock on the main screen is the time this mosque uses.","Quran 4:103","Quran","4:103","Sunnah extra units differ by school. Follow this mosque. Open Salah to tick what you have prayed.",B.W1)
B.WV=new A.a8(984725,"MaterialIcons",!1)
B.YH=new A.dW("wudu","worship","Wudu \u2014 washing before prayer","The Quran names the fard wash: the face, the arms to the elbows, wipe the head, and the feet to the ankles. How much is sunnah, and what to do if you have a cast or cannot use water, is for the imam \u2014 not this screen.","Quran 5:6","Quran","5:6",null,B.WV)
B.Wi=new A.a8(63257,"MaterialIcons",!1)
B.YO=new A.dW("friday","worship","Friday \u2014 Jumu\u2019ah","On Friday, leave business and come to the mosque for the khutbah and the prayer. The time is set by this mosque, not by a random website.","Quran 62:9","Quran","62:9",null,B.Wi)
B.VU=new A.a8(61974,"MaterialIcons",!1)
B.YR=new A.dW("ramadan","worship","Fasting in Ramadan","Able adults fast from before Fajr until Maghrib in Ramadan. The start of the month is announced by this mosque after the moon. If a website and this mosque disagree, follow this mosque.","Quran 2:183","Quran","2:183",null,B.VU)
B.YK=new A.dW("zakat","worship","Zakat","Zakat is a required share of qualifying wealth, not a tip. Many people give 2.5% after a lunar year, once they are above the nisab. This app does not work out your number. Ask the imam.","Quran 2:43","Quran","2:43","Open Donate when you are ready to give through this mosque.",B.nS)
B.YT=new A.dW("hajj","worship","Hajj","Hajj is once in a lifetime for the person who can. It is in Dhul Hijjah. This mosque can point you to a trusted group. Do not book from an advert alone.","Quran 3:97","Quran","3:97",null,B.ul)
B.WU=new A.a8(984585,"MaterialIcons",!1)
B.YN=new A.dW("manners","life","In the mosque","Come clean, dress modestly, silence the phone, fill the gaps in the rows, and do not step over people who are praying. If you are unsure, watch the regulars and ask.","Mosque manners \u2014 ask the imam for detail","Guidance",null,"This is everyday courtesy, not a list of fatwas.",B.WU)
B.Wg=new A.a8(63244,"MaterialIcons",!1)
B.YM=new A.dW("new","life","If you are new","You are welcome. Nobody is born knowing this. Open Shahada if you want to become Muslim, then speak with the imam in person. This app has no convert button.","This mosque","Guidance",null,null,B.Wg)
